  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[F]\n[Em]\n[Dm7][G7]I'm\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]crazy, [Bb]\n[A7]crazy for feeling so\n[Dm]lonely\nI'm\n[G7]crazy,\ncrazy for feeling so\n[C]blue [Dbdim7]\n[Dm7]  [G7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]I knew [Bb]that\n[A7]you'd love me as long as\n[Dm]you wanted\nAnd then\n[G7]someday, you'd\nleave me for somebo-\n[C]dy new [Dm7]\n[Dbdim7]  [C7]\n\n[Interlude]\n[F]Worry,\nwhy do I [Gbdim7]let myself\n[C]worry?\n[B]  [C]  [Db]\n[D7]Wondering\nwhat in the world did I\n[G7]do?\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]I'm crazy [Bb]for\n[A7]thinking that my love could\n[Dm]hold you\n[Dm7]I'm\n[F]crazy for [Em]trying and\n[Dm7]crazy for [A7]crying And\n[Dm7]I'm crazy for [G7]loving\n[C]you [Ab]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]I'm crazy [B]for\n[Bb7]thinking that my love could\n[Ebm]hold you\n[Ebm7]I'm\n[Gb]crazy for [Fm]trying and\n[Ebm7]crazy [Bb7]for crying And\n[Ebm7]I'm crazy for [Ab7]loving\n[Db]you\n\n[Outro]\n[Db]\n[Gb7]\n[Db]",
